  <default sync-j="16" />

  <!-- Corpus, and keypoint detection.

       The corpus this renders and the model it trains: 104-keypoint wholebody detection
       from ANNY renders, with pose-consensus refereeing what a pose actually was.
       
       entities-godot appears twice because CineForm carries the depth the renderer
       writes, and the reader has to be reviewed against a main that moved under it.
       
       The sinew projects are here rather than beside the mesh work because motion
       capture produces keypoints, which is the same label this corpus supervises.
  -->

